# Stable spec ID: iba-espresso-martini. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(vodka) 50 ml
(coffee liqueur @ Kahlúa) 30 ml
(simple syrup) 10 ml
(coffee; espresso) 1 strong espresso

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass)>
<garnish, with 3 coffee beans>

